WEBVTT

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.037
they are no longer reasonable
or appropriate.

00:11:01.061 --> 00:11:04.840
You can't and you shouldn't swing a club
every time you're provoked.

00:11:04.864 --> 00:11:07.704
(Laughter)

00:11:07.728 --> 00:11:09.466
But here's the good news.

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:10.914
You are capable of something

00:11:10.938 --> 00:11:13.395
your nonhuman ancestors
weren't capable of.

00:11:13.419 --> 00:11:16.777
And that is the capacity
to regulate your emotions.

00:11:17.174 --> 00:11:18.968
Even when you want to lash out,

00:11:18.992 --> 00:11:21.674
you can stop yourself
and you can channel that anger

00:11:21.698 --> 00:11:23.765
into something more productive.

00:11:24.119 --> 00:11:25.918
So often when we talk about anger,

00:11:25.942 --> 00:11:28.609
we talk about how to keep
from getting angry.

00:11:28.633 --> 00:11:31.164
We tell people to calm down or relax.